told that $\\overset{\\to }{OA}=a,$ so we just need to work out $\\overset{\\to }{AC}.$\n\nFirst, from $△OAB,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{AB} & =\\overset{\\to }{AO}+\\overset{\\to }{OB} \\\\  & =-\\overset{\\to }{OA}+\\overset{\\to }{OB} \\\\  & =-a+b \\\\  & =b-a.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $AC:CB=5:1,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\overset{\\to }{AC}=\\frac{5}{6}\\overset{\\to }{AB}=\\frac{5}{6}(b-a).\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{OC} & =\\overset{\\to }{OA}+\\overset{\\to }{AC} \\\\  & =a+\\frac{5}{6}(b-a) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{6}a+\\frac{5}{6}b.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186294966 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a8cc1233-884e-55c1-bc0b-5c72b12ac47b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2}{5}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293600}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a8cc1233-884e-55c1-bc0b-5c72b12ac47b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2}{5}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293600} :answer-field/id #uuid "2b1935e4-b1db-59ac-bdd1-af6a29d2f762" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186294076} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6f22b1a6-2bb1-5ce8-b04f-37229ed9ed7a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3}{5}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293395}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6f22b1a6-2bb1-5ce8-b04f-37229ed9ed7a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3}{5}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293395} :answer-field/id #uuid "3ea5bc20-1829-57bc-bf77-805686187035" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186294146}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "02a8ac13-d9fd-5011-b248-20d1e825aecc" :question/math-academy-id "q-278263" :question/problem "![](images/c2/c26ec7e1fccc5ada4c43eef55faf9e4fa3e17ed896b1546