overset{\\to }{OF} & =\\overset{\\to }{OD}+\\overset{\\to }{DF} \\\\  & =d+\\frac{3}{7}(e-d) \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{7}d+\\frac{3}{7}e.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186302112 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8d9de2aa-4041-5f76-b6be-fe41ae2704f6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{7}{13}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300678}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8d9de2aa-4041-5f76-b6be-fe41ae2704f6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{7}{13}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300678} :answer-field/id #uuid "894293cb-5bcb-5c58-bcf1-8fa19684d17e" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186301658} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "115586ce-ea68-5b73-b06d-7488ecd05e55" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{6}{13}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300032}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "115586ce-ea68-5b73-b06d-7488ecd05e55" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{6}{13}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300032} :answer-field/id #uuid "cdd6dde1-aa3a-5f12-b998-fbca206e7fd2" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186301888}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "ba11ec48-b1bc-5ad5-b2d2-084fb1f0daf5" :question/math-academy-id "q-322574" :question/problem "![](images/2a/2a9cacfc6787e60229076c4abd2854709d51ac718c8d519256a61dbe92852b05.png)\n\nConsider the diagram above, where $\\overset{\\to }{OG}=g,$ $\\overset{\\to }{OH}=h,$ and $J$ divides $\\overset{―}{GH}$ in the ratio $GJ:JH=6:7.$ Express $\\overset{\\to }{OJ}$ via the vectors $g$ and $h.$\n\n$\\,\\overset{\\to }{OJ}=$\n{{field-1}}\n$g+$\n{{field-2}}\n$h$" :question/worked-solution "From the diagram, we see that\n\n$$\n\\overset{\\to }{OJ}=\\overset{\\to }{OG}+\\overset{\\to }{GJ}.\n$$\n\nWe're told that $\\overset{\\to }{OG}=g,$ so we just need to work out $\\overset{\\to }{GJ}.$\n\nFirst, from $△OGH,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{GH} & =\\overset{\\to }{GO}+\\overset{\\to }{OH} \\\\  & =-\\overset{\\to }{OG}+\\overset{\\to }{OH} \\\\  & =-g+h \\\\  & =h-g.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $GJ:JH=6:7,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\overset{\\to }{GJ}=\\frac{6}{13}\\overset{\\to }{GH}=\\frac{6}{13}(h-g).\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{OJ} & =\\overset{\\to }{OG}+\\overset{\\to }{GJ} \\\\  & =g+\\frac{6}{13}(h-g) \\\\  & =\\frac{7}{13}g+\\frac{6}{13}h.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186302113 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e48e2a50-28f2-5163-870b-8afa809e432c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{9}{13}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186301097}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e48e2a50-28f2-5163-870b-8afa809e432c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{9}{13}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186301097} :answer-field/id #uuid "1b3110a3-3c76-50a9-8099-660e479f8913" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186301315} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "fbbc76d5-fe38-5e97-a234-8280ad9d288f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{4}{13}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186301211}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "fbbc76d5-fe38-5e97-a234-8280ad9d288f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{4}{13}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186301211} :answer-field/id #uuid "aa3c4a6c-7827-538e-a831-35325998bb72" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186301774}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "192ab3c2-7926-59cc-a0a7-34dbb7dda250" :question/math-academy-id "q-322575" :question/problem "![](images/d9/d9448f9f05666f9806975b37a73f09c492eb73139b6f9395b619f077f3a584c9.png)\n\nConsider the diagram above, where $\\overset{\\to }{OP}=p,$ $\\overset{\\to }{OQ}=q,$ and $R$ divides $\\overset{―}{PQ}$ in the ratio $PR:RQ=4:9.$ Express $\\overset{\\to }{OR}$ via the vectors $p$ and $q.$\n\n$\\,\\overset{\\to }{OR}=$\n{{field-1}}\n$p+$\n{{field-2}}\n$q$" :question/worked-solution "From the diagram, we see that\n\n$$\n\\overset{\\to }{OR}=\\overset{\\to }{OP}+\\overset{\\to }{PR}.\n$$\n\nWe're told that $\\overset{\\to }{OP}=p,$ so we just need to work out $\\overset{\\to }{PR}.$\n\nFirst, from $△OPQ,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{PQ} & =\\overset{\\to }{PO}+\\overset{\\to }{OQ} \\\\  & =-\\overset{\\to }{OP}+\\overset{\\to }{OQ} \\\\  & =-p+q \\\\  & =q-p.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $PR:RQ=4:9,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\overset{\\to }{PR}=\\frac{4}{13}\\overset{\\to }{PQ}=\\frac{4}{13}(q-p).\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{OR} & =\\overset{\\to }{OP}+\\overset{\\to }{PR} \\\\  & =p+\\frac{4}{13}(q-p) \\\\  & =\\frac{9}{13}p+\\frac{4}{13}q.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186302114 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9b14b714-b52b-5d04-b557-997d58e4906b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{8}{11}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300742}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9b14b714-b52b-5d04-b557-997d58e4906b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{8}{11}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300742} :answer-field/id #uuid "7f9d3030-0df2-534d-a2aa-d2de45556fcc" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186301626} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ed2752f0-24b6-5acd-9348-7f0e4dc496b1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3}{11}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186301132}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ed2752f0-24b6-5acd-9348-7f0e4dc496b1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3}{11}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186301132} :answer-field/id #uuid "bf21a52d-986f-53a9-827a-aa6185c06320" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186301853}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "4310688d-8e77-5533-8343-0450b5396777" :question/math-academy-id "q-322576" :question/problem "![](images/36/36742531a5f9f5d77c5f7e90980120479f4142cecaf6e84937d76d938688409d.png)\n\nConsider the diagram above, where $\\overset{\\to }{OM}=d,$ $\\overset{\\to }{ON}=e,$ and $T$ divides $\\overset{―}{MN}$ in the ratio $MT:TN=8:3.$ Express $\\overset{\\to }{OT}$ via the vectors $d$ and $e.$\n\n$\\,\\overset{\\to }{OT}=$\n{{field-1}}\n$d+$\n{{field-2}}\n$e$" :question/worked-solution "From the diagram, we see that\n\n$$\n\\overset{\\to }{OT}=\\overset{\\to }{OM}+\\overset{\\to }{MT}.\n$$\n\nWe're told that $\\overset{\\to }{OM}=d,$ so we just need to work out $\\overset{\\to }{MT}.$\n\nFirst, from $△OMN,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{MN} & =\\overset{\\to }{MO}+\\overset{\\to }{ON} \\\\  & =-\\overset{\\to }{OM}+\\overset{\\to }{ON} \\\\  & =-d+e \\\\  & =e-d.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $MT:TN=8:3,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\overset{\\to }{MT}=\\frac{8}{11}\\overset{\\to }{MN}=\\frac{8}{11}(e-d).\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{OT} & =\\overset{\\to }{OM}+\\overset{\\to }{MT} \\\\  & =d+\\frac{8}{11}(e-d) \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{11}d+\\frac{8}{11}e.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186302115 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7e2a1c00-8cb8-59b8-999c-b1980e06520e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{8}{17}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300587}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7e2a1c00-8cb8-59b8-999c-b1980e06520e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{8}{17}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300587} :answer-field/id #uuid "268f3bd7-dd2a-5bdb-bad4-117ce7290310" :answe