\\frac{1}{3}u+\\frac{2}{3}v" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186327054} {:answer/id #uuid "12bc31bd-410e-5cec-b3e8-db5ec16e6668" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\overset{\\to }{OW}=\\frac{7}{9}v-\\frac{2}{9}u" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186327095} {:answer/id #uuid "1d8032c3-8159-562d-b85e-ce01f3a9419c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\overset{\\to }{OW}=\\frac{7}{9}u+\\frac{2}{9}v" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186327189} {:answer/id #uuid "ccd9827b-fe26-5576-843d-788fca86322f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\overset{\\to }{OW}=\\frac{2}{3}u+\\frac{1}{3}v" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186328732} {:answer/id #uuid "f6116bad-8f2c-5913-918c-8429cac9d1d4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\overset{\\to }{OW}=-\\frac{1}{3}v+\\frac{2}{3}u" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186329092}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1d8032c3-8159-562d-b85e-ce01f3a9419c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\overset{\\to }{OW}=\\frac{7}{9}u+\\frac{2}{9}v" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186327189} :answer-field/id #uuid "624e21c0-b503-5eed-93a7-5e549f2e0d0a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186329358}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "cfe5446c-2b26-5e48-974b-de364027f648" :question/math-academy-id "q-42669" :question/problem "![](images/04/040127594f639248736d4492f1853bcb1e6ef18c37db9242ebe466045713628a.png)\n\nConsider the diagram above, where $\\overset{\\to }{OU}=u,$ $\\overset{\\to }{OV}=v$ and $W$ divides $\\overset{―}{UV}$ in the ratio $UW:WV=2:7.$ Find $\\overset{\\to }{OW}.$" :question/worked-solution "From the diagram, we see that\n\n$$\n\\overset{\\to }{OW}=\\overset{\\to }{OU}+\\overset{\\to }{UW}.\n$$\n\nWe're told that $\\overset{\\to }{OU}=u,$ so we just need to work out $\\overset{\\to }{UW}.$\n\nFirst, from $△OUV,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{UV} & =\\overset{\\to }{UO}+\\overset{\\to }{OV} \\\\  & =-\\overset{\\to }{OU}+\\overset{\\to }{OV} \\\\  & =-u+v \\\\  & =v-u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $UW:WV=2:7,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\overset{\\to }{UW}=\\frac{2}{9}\\overset{\\to }{UV}=\\frac{2}{9}(v-u).\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{OW} & =\\overset{\\to }{OU}+\\overset{\\to }{UW} \\\\  & =u+\\frac{2}{9}(v-u) \\\\  & =\\frac{7}{9}u+\\frac{2}{9}v.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186387001 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "20a4ecfa-47e2-56f4-a423-468e55f93529" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\overset{\\to }{OJ}=\\frac{1}{2}h+\\frac{1}{2}i" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387003} {:answer/id #uuid "e23408c0-6a35-5afe-abe2-00bbdaf4622a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\overset{\\to }{OJ}=\\frac{3}{4}h+\\frac{1}{4}i" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387004} {:answer/id #uuid "a498dbcf-0f77-508b-9c07-efe06b97d9ed" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\overset{\\to }{OJ}=\\frac{5}{8}h+\\frac{3}{8}i" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387005} {:answer/id #uuid "748b1bc5-d773-5fa4-a285-111048597c9c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\overset{\\to }{OJ}=\\frac{1}{8}h+\\frac{3}{4}i" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387006} {:answer/id #uuid "86f8cb36-0676-5c61-8d2f-37ebe1006578" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\overset{\\to }{OJ}=\\frac{3}{8}h+\\frac{5}{8}i" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387007}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "86f8cb36-0676-5c61-8d2f-37ebe1006578" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\overset{\\to }{OJ}=\\frac{3}{8}h+\\frac{5}{8}i" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387007} :answer-field/id #uuid "3c4f4208-0c8e-57ef-ad8c-1decee05823d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387002}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "c0b691a2-9da7-5f9d-b601-8f5daf61f352" :question/math-academy-id "q-120304" :question/problem "![](images/65/6560a7f05ae95638cbfe902dfa022b2d8de6b07c6e1e6f85051ccf87b92ec338.png)\n\nConsider the diagram above, where $\\overset{\\to }{OH}=h,$ $\\overset{\\to }{OI}=i$ and $J$ divides $\\overset{―}{HI}$ in the ratio $HJ:JI=5:3.$ Find $\\overset{\\to }{OJ}.$" :question/worked-solution "From the diagram, we see that\n\n$$\n\\overset{\\to }{OJ}=\\overset{\\to }{OH}+\\overset{\\to }{HJ}.\n$$\n\nWe're told that $\\overset{\\to }{OH}=h,$ so we just need to work out $\\overset{\\to }{HJ}.$\n\nFirst, from $△OHI,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{HI} & =\\overset{\\to }{HO}+\\overset{\\to }{OI} \\\\  & =-\\overset{\\to }{OH}+\\overset{\\to }{OI} \\\\  & =-h+i \\\\  & =i-h.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $HJ:JI=5:3,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\overset{\\to }{HJ}=\\frac{5}{8}\\overset{\\to }{HI}=\\frac{5}{8}(i-h).\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{OJ} & =\\overset{\\to }{OH}+\\overset{\\to }{HJ} \\\\  & =h+\\frac{5}{8}(i-h) \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{8}h+\\frac{5}{8}i.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186390558 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e6c08254-bcec-5457-b88b-bb1b31577752" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\overset{\\to }{OV}=\\frac{5}{6}r+\\frac{1}{6}s" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186390560} {:answer/id #uuid "86737275-5bda-5fe0-92b5-103129881f25" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\overset{\\to }{OV}=\\frac{6}{11}r+\\frac{5}{11}s" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186390561} {:answer/id #uuid "361d2b59-2e0b-5aa1-b524-15d353a4c2a5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\overset{\\to }{OV}=r+\\frac{5}{6}s" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186390562} {:answer/id #uuid "b20f5119-753b-5441-bf91-ce6580448a69" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\overset{\\to }{OV}=\\frac{5}{11}r+\\frac{6}{11}s" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186390563} {:answer/id #uuid "04d1bf75-797e-5041-b6