f $y=\\csc x.$\n\n![](images/f1/f1b80c29b8f9f4d33aae94fc287d95b97cc5865b36ecc98f4f41e625dfc842e1.png)\n\nNow, let's go through each statement.\n\n- The range of the function is $(-\\infty,-1]\\cup[1,\\infty)$.  Hence, statement I is false.\n\n- The cosecant graph does not intersect the $x$-axis. Hence, statement II is true.\n\n- The range is unbounded above and below, so the function has no global minimum or maximum. Hence, statement III is true."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186517009 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2fb9c4b4-6a03-5f4c-8bc7-b7ba26702b94" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517006} {:answer/id #uuid "def743f6-4424-5051-bba9-7dac7f3e0b11" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517081}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2fb9c4b4-6a03-5f4c-8bc7-b7ba26702b94" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517006} :answer-field/id #uuid "4ed8b970-8ba0-5072-a868-269aa5a9c229" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517026} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3473a9aa-26bc-5223-b3ed-a5837f9c82c2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517008} {:answer/id #uuid "3eedbeac-50ae-5e30-b8ae-188d65d442f0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517013}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3473a9aa-26bc-5223-b3ed-a5837f9c82c2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517008} :answer-field/id #uuid "78ffc1d8-3ab3-5623-82bb-f1b73173902a" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517045} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4ec23a44-2c1d-50d3-a525-d5351d45e1b8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text