the graph of $y=\\csc x.$\n\n![](images/f1/f1b80c29b8f9f4d33aae94fc287d95b97cc5865b36ecc98f4f41e625dfc842e1.png)\n\nNow, let's go through each statement.\n\n- The range of the function is $(-\\infty,-1]\\cup[1,\\infty)$.  Hence, statement I is true.\n\n- The cosecant graph does not intersect the $x$-axis. Hence, statement II is false.\n\n- The graph does not intersect the $y$-axis, as $x=0$ is not in the domain. Hence, statement III is false."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186517031 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "77393571-ce31-5f63-beaf-003ff290501d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517043} {:answer/id #uuid "7822cda3-c180-54b1-ae7d-4b6df399d2db" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517044}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "77393571-ce31-5f63-beaf-003ff290501d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517043} :answer-field/id #uuid "278a75f0-f4d2-535c-b4fe-bdfe3ca2fc93" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517001} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a060bac0-d972-5929-954d-efb7c692c018" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517058} {:answer/id #uuid "be313153-7819-5ff9-bbc0-b12b82ba8e3e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517070}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "be313153-7819-5ff9-bbc0-b12b82ba8e3e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517070} :answer-field/id #uuid "2d06a9c3-5924-51ae-a2fa-9e0de39ccee5" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517005} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3f0264c2-6175-53c9-a115-e6ef053e0035" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517014} {:answer/id #uuid "e3c3d0a3-03b6-5bbf-80e4-439eb7c076a3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517084}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3f0264c2-6175-53c9-a115-e6ef053e0035" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517014} :answer-field/id #uuid "70c498a9-ee8e-5f91-b9c6-c1194e84a9eb" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517040}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "58f443a0-5e86-50b9-8fb5-cff53ee8ef40" :question/problem "Which of the following statements are true regarding the function $y=\\csc x$?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** The point $(\\frac{11\\pi }{2},1)$ is on the graph.\n- **II.** $x=-8\\pi $ is a vertical asymptote.\n- **III.** $x=\\frac{11\\pi }{2}$ is in the domain." :question/worked-solution "Let's plot the graph of $y=\\csc x.$\n\n![](images/f1/f1b80c29b8f9f4d33aae94fc287d95b97cc5865b36ecc98f4f41e625dfc842e1.png)\n\nNow, let's go through each statement.\n\n- The cosecant takes the value $-1$ at $x=\\frac{11\\pi }{2}$. Hence, statement I is false.\n\n- The lines $x=n\\pi$ for any integer $n$ are the vertical asymptotes of the function. Hence, statement II is true.\n\n- The domain excludes exactly the integer multiples of $\\pi$. The number $\\frac{11\\pi }{2}$ is not an integer multiple of $\\pi$. Hence, statement III is true."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186517038 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "029905eb-f32e-56f7-816a-edf98d09bd33" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186516988} {:answer/id #uuid "d768524b-3951-56ce-a481-d434e040922c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517077}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d768524b-3951-56ce-a481-d434e040