alue of the function.\n- **III.** $x=-2\\pi $ is in the domain." :question/worked-solution "Let's plot the graph of $y=\\operatorname{csc}⁡x.$\n\n![](images/f1/f1b80c29b8f9f4d33aae94fc287d95b97cc5865b36ecc98f4f41e625dfc842e1.png)\n\nNow, let's go through each statement.\n\n- The range of the function is $(-\\infty ,-1]\\cup [1,\\infty ),$ therefore the function doesn't have a maximum value. Hence, statements I and II are both false.\n\n- The function's domain is all real numbers except the integer multiples of $\\pi $, such as $0,\\pm \\pi ,\\pm 2\\pi ,….$ Hence, statement III is false."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186517054 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "20abb560-7b52-56cb-89b9-7e88732a11bd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186516998} {:answer/id #uuid "b8fdbb2e-622b-571f-8def-616d61ba52b1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517065}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "20abb560-7b52-56cb-89b9-7e88732a11bd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186516998} :answer-field/id #uuid "093ec8c9-7e49-51e0-bd47-03ffc374bee7" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186516990} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "296e57fa-25d3-5b07-b6ff-29c37a87f6af" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517003} {:answer/id #uuid "e0b3aa4b-ab01-59f9-aefc-de045b03f02b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517083}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "296e57fa-25d3-5b07-b6ff-29c37a87f6af" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517003} :answer-field/id #uuid "dfe2f622-054f-5421-9039-2fd9fb4b22ee" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/