ue" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517028} {:answer/id #uuid "5d7fcce2-8ed2-5d9b-bd74-a9ff620d2360" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517032}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5d7fcce2-8ed2-5d9b-bd74-a9ff620d2360" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517032} :answer-field/id #uuid "3f2ca583-f967-594b-a2e2-daf15c919d20" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517015} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "46187b3d-a8a0-5e46-8aa1-0744ffa059fe" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517020} {:answer/id #uuid "a06b4390-6b52-5ed9-874d-1c6e93e4fa75" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517059}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a06b4390-6b52-5ed9-874d-1c6e93e4fa75" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517059} :answer-field/id #uuid "cddd997b-d915-554f-ada4-074d6c5a4dd3" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517073} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e6a63691-d789-5720-9a9e-c40a5ba17930" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517086} {:answer/id #uuid "ed215f5f-d18f-59b3-98dc-3ebb8152ebd5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517090}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e6a63691-d789-5720-9a9e-c40a5ba17930" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517086} :answer-field/id #uuid "f22f6d76-facb-575e-b4c0-35505f62cfa1" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517091}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "b39f1a26-af7a-5fd3-b7d9-2fa382bc016c" :question/problem "Which of the following statements are true regarding the function $y=\\csc x$?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** The range is all real numbers.\n- **II.** The graph does not intersect the $y$-axis.\n- **III.** The function has no global minimum or maximum." :question/worked-solution "Let's plot the graph of $y=\\csc x.$\n\n![](images/f1/f1b80c29b8f9f4d33aae94fc287d95b97cc5865b36ecc98f4f41e625dfc842e1.png)\n\nNow, let's go through each statement.\n\n- The range of the function is $(-\\infty,-1]\\cup[1,\\infty)$.  Hence, statement I is false.\n\n- The graph does not intersect the $y$-axis, as $x=0$ is not in the domain. Hence, statement II is true.\n\n- The range is unbounded above and below, so the function has no global minimum or maximum. Hence, statement III is true."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186517094 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "454820d6-a5f0-56e6-b8e6-96274b650934" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517019} {:answer/id #uuid "e4c1d33e-9364-594c-8519-61a5af0b4f3c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517085}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "454820d6-a5f0-56e6-b8e6-96274b650934" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517019} :answer-field/id #uuid "75520965-5e52-58bd-9fdd-b7cc3e312072" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517042} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "435434a0-59e2-5c23-843b-8dc1a9d71c28" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517017} {:answer/id #uuid "51410d88-b1a6-5ba9-87b6-29af36c17940" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517027}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "435434a0-59e2-5c23-843b-8dc1a9d71c28" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517017} :answer-field/id #uuid "8dad2840-782d-5d64-92c4-5ba4946194c4" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517053} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "620189dd-e716-5a6f-941c-41f3b1f6bed5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517033} {:answer/id #uuid "cab7e494-6c3d-53de-bdc0-7127833308ed" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517072}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "cab7e494-6c3d-53de-bdc0-7127833308ed" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517072} :answer-field/id #uuid "922ddb9a-fd35-5f64-a9ac-56848dbbabfa" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517055}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "f88d4101-5b98-5a6e-abf9-19b6874206de" :question/problem "Which of the following statements are true regarding the function $y=\\csc x$?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** The point $(\\frac{9\\pi }{2},-1)$ is on the graph.\n- **II.** $x=11\\pi $ is a vertical asymptote.\n- **III.** $x=\\frac{7\\pi }{2}$ is in the domain." :question/worked-solution "Let's plot the graph of $y=\\csc x.$\n\n![](images/f1/f1b80c29b8f9f4d33aae94fc287d95b97cc5865b36ecc98f4f41e625dfc842e1.png)\n\nNow, let's go through each statement.\n\n- The cosecant takes the value $1$ at $x=\\frac{9\\pi }{2}$. Hence, statement I is false.\n\n- The lines $x=n\\pi$ for any integer $n$ are the vertical asymptotes of the function. Hence, statement II is true.\n\n- The domain excludes exactly the integer multiples of $\\pi$. The number $\\frac{7\\pi }{2}$ is not an integer multiple of $\\pi$. Hence, statement III is true."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186517095 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4e08accb-7eda-5b3f-8f7f-cf6049c19834" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517023} {:answer/id #uuid "53ceef81-cbcf-5469-a654-9c8dc64c15b7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517029}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "4e08accb-7eda-5b3f-8f7f-cf6049c19834" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517023} :answer-field/id #uuid "01a3e318-485f-572e-9d51-28ff9e7bc115" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186516987} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3d9fcad0-b7c1-5b69-9f63-65e152eb6676" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517011} {:answer/id #uuid "ba6d4175-e2fb-5a81-aa89-ea597fed72d0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517067}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ba6d4175-e2fb-5a81-aa89-ea597fed72d0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517067} :answer-field/id #uuid "2b450d50-fe98-5b6a-bbb9-5b94a6399b59" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517004} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "879bbe6d-6321-5aa6-9fca-0e98609ffa91" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517051} {:answer/id #uuid "8837bdf2-18a9-5865-b0d8-61465361cb77" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517052}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "879bbe6d-6321-5aa6-9fca-0e98609ffa91" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517051} :answer-field/id #uuid "628f5a29-72f4-5abf-8e2c-51bccdc1b9fa" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517034}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "fb8b6ba6-3782-5361-89b1-1ab426047925" :question/problem "Which of the following statements are true regarding the function $y=\\csc x$?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** The point $(\\frac{9\\pi }{2},-1)$ is on the graph.\n- **II.** $x=-3\\pi $ is a vertical asymptote.\n- **III.** $x=\\frac{-4\\pi }{2}$ is in the domain." :question/worked-solution "Let's plot the graph of $y=\\csc x.$\n\n![](images/f1/f1b80c29b8f9f4d33aae94fc287d95b97cc5865b36ecc98f4f41e625dfc842e1.png)\n\nNow, let's go through each statement.\n\n- The cosecant takes the value $1$ at $x=\\frac{9\\pi }{2}$. Hence, statement I is false.\n\n- The lines $x=n\\pi$ for any integer $n$ are the vertical asymptotes of the function. Hence, statement II is true.\n\n- The domain excludes exactly the integer multiples of $\\pi$. The number $\\frac{-4\\pi }{2}$ is an integer multiple of $\\pi$. Hence, statement III is false."}] :knowledge-point/title "Describing the General Properties of the Cosecant Function"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186176054 :knowledge-point/canonical-example {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186175700 :question/id #uuid "a1713375-241f-5a53-a109-3c3d0f917411" :question/math-academy-id "e-11009" :question/problem "If $\\csc x = 8,$ then what is $\\csc(x-8\\pi)?$" :question/worked-solution "The period of $y = \\csc x$ is $2\\pi.$ Therefore, for integer $n$ we have\n\n$$\n\\csc{x} = \\csc{(x+2n\\pi)} .\n$$\n\nSubstituting $n=-4$ into the right-hand-side of the above gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{csc}⁡x & =\\operatorname{csc}⁡(x+2\\cdot (-4)\\cdot \\pi ) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{csc}⁡(x-8\\pi ).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, if $\\csc{x} = 8,$ then $\\csc{(x-8\\pi)} = 8.$"} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "37434c3e-2269-5b08-94c5-7516df7879b2" :knowledge-point/key-prerequisites [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186049353 :topic/math-academy-id 2148 :topic/title "Periodic Functions"}] :knowledge-point/que